  "worked_solution": "The figure consists of two layers:\n\n- The bottom layer consists of $8$ cubes.\n\n- The top layer consists of $3$ cubes.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14132963/assets/4ce6ba7062ca52e2d658778238977c265586495b952d79069f76f718a27af56d.png)\n\nTherefore, the volume is $8+3=11$ cubic feet.",
